WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.338
When you switch between projects,

2
00:00:02.338 --> 00:00:05.920
the bottom line tells you where
you are and what pi is doing.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.627
This session starts on
the main branch of greet.

4
00:00:10.627 --> 00:00:13.786
Turn on plan mode and the
footer says planning.

5
00:00:13.786 --> 00:00:17.080
Leave it again and the
footer goes back to ready.

6
00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:29.181
Ready means pi is waiting
for your next instruction.

7
00:00:29.181 --> 00:00:33.507
When you need proof a change works,
look for the check that ran.
